{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42586","headline":"谢翁宏以诗百篇见示 · 廖融","name":"谢翁宏以诗百篇见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高奇一百篇，造化见工全。\n积思游沧海，冥搜入洞天。\n神珠迷罔象，端玉匪雕镌。\n休叹不得力，离骚千古传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"廖融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}